  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Syria - UNICEF reg response Iraqi refugees 2011 - Jordan/Syria - Iraqi refugees</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syrien - UNICEF reg irakiska flyktingar 2011</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Humanitarian support to UN Regional Response Plan for Iraqi Refugees 2011. Support is given to Jordan and Syria with the highest amount of Iraqi refugees in the region. The activity aims among others to contribute to that children and youth have access to education and that youth access youth friendly activities. Vulnerable women are also included in the target group.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Humanit&#xE4;rt st&#xF6;d till FN regionala appell f&#xF6;r Irakiska flyktingar 2011. St&#xF6;det ges till Jordanien och Syrien d&#xE4;r det flesta antalet irakiska flyktingar i regionen vistas. Insatsen syftar bl.a. till att fr&#xE4;mja att barn och ungdomar har tillg&#xE5;ng till skolg&#xE5;ng och ungdomar till aktiviteter. Utsatta kvinnor ing&#xE5;r &#xE4;ven som m&#xE5;lgrupp.</narrative>
  </description>
